<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <record id="view_inventory_activity_policy_list" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">mc.rov.inventory.activity.policy.list</field>
        <field name="model">mc.rov.inventory.activity.policy</field>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <list>
                <field name="company_id"/>
                <field name="enabled"/>
                <field name="calendar_id"/>
                <field name="lead_days"/>
                <field name="configuration_message"/>
            </list>
        </field>
    </record>
    <record id="view_inventory_activity_policy_form" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">mc.rov.inventory.activity.policy.form</field>
        <field name="model">mc.rov.inventory.activity.policy</field>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <form string="Seguimiento de inventario">
                <sheet>
                    <group>
                        <group>
                            <field name="company_id"/>
                            <field name="enabled"/>
                        </group>
                        <group>
                            <field name="calendar_id" domain="['|', ('company_id', '=', False), ('company_id', '=', company_id)]"/>
                            <field name="lead_days"/>
                        </group>
                    </group>
                    <field name="configuration_message"/>
                    <separator string="Operaciones seleccionadas"/>
                    <field name="rule_ids">
                        <list editable="bottom">
                            <field name="company_id" column_invisible="True"/>
                            <field name="picking_type_id" domain="[('company_id', '=', parent.company_id), ('code', 'in', ['incoming', 'outgoing', 'internal'])]" options="{'no_create': True}"/>
                            <field name="user_id" domain="[('share', '=', False), ('active', '=', True), ('company_ids', 'in', [parent.company_id])]" options="{'no_create': True}"/>
                            <field name="employee_id" domain="[('active', '=', True), ('company_id', '=', parent.company_id)]" options="{'no_create': True}"/>
                        </list>
                    </field>
                    <p>El plazo empieza en la confirmación o en la fecha prevista inicial si es futura. Se excluye ese día y se conserva cualquier límite nativo anterior.</p>
                    <p>Esta configuración solo afecta a seguimientos nuevos: no mueve plazos existentes, no crea compras y no valida movimientos ni aplica conteos.</p>
                </sheet>
            </form>
        </field>
    </record>
    <record id="action_inventory_activity_policy" model="ir.actions.act_window">
        <field name="name">Seguimiento de inventario</field>
        <field name="res_model">mc.rov.inventory.activity.policy</field>
        <field name="view_mode">list,form</field>
    </record>
    <menuitem id="menu_inventory_activity_policy" name="Inventario"
              parent="menu_work_automation" action="action_inventory_activity_policy"
              groups="mc_rov.group_work_assignment_coordinate" sequence="50"/>
</odoo>
